      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62def87167455d44a141e91e|full_name}: So from what I'm getting from this are we supposed to make 2 separate parameters just to drive a contact interaction, or are we supposed to put that in the VRC Expression Parameter list when Avatar Dynamics initially came out said that the parameters didn't need to be put in the parameter list were automatically synced? If it's supposed to be in the VRC Expression Parameter list could we at least see the documentation with regards to Avatar Dynamics be updated to reflect this to prevent user generated errors when making avatars?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
