      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name}: could contacts at least be given a better smoothening over the network than they are currently? They consistently jitter regardless of frame rate and that's basically what one of the major issues is with contacts. their delta time is worse than the delta time for physbones",
      "viewerReactions": null,
